## Attribution

astryx-svelte is an unofficial, community-led Svelte port of Astryx
(https://astryx.atmeta.com/), Meta's open-source design system, which is
released under the MIT License. Meta's copyright notice is reproduced above
verbatim, as that license requires.

Material derived from Astryx includes the component APIs and prop contracts,
the design tokens and their values, the documentation prose, and the test
suites, which are ported case for case. The Svelte 5 implementation, the
StyleX-to-Svelte adapter layer, and the CLI's codemod runner are this project's
own work.

This project is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Meta. It
ships none of Meta's trademarks or logos; "Astryx" is used descriptively, to
name the design system this is a port of.
